# Local sync-incident recovery duplicates (07_Archive/sync_dupes_*) — dupes of
# vault content already backed up; not worth mirroring to Drive. They are cold and
# get iCloud-evicted to dataless stubs (DQ-52), which deadlocks rclone's hash pass
# and aborts the WHOLE backup. Excluding them keeps the nightly backup running
# through the eviction. Steve can delete these local folders anytime (they are dupes).
07_Archive/sync_dupes_*/**
